W: 4. They both sat down upon the bed
W: Just for the side of half one hour
W: And not a word did either speak
W: But down their cheeks the tears did shower
W: She laid her head upon his breast
W: As round his neck her arms entwined
W: Not a duke nor lord nor earl I’ll wed
W: I’ll wait for you my own Matt Hyland
